  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "UNKNOWN ≠ FAILED",
      "items": [
        "租约丢失时副作用/持久化结果不可判定：标 UNKNOWN 挂起，等 reconcileExecution 显式对账",
        "持久化校验 fencingToken：失联 worker 的迟到写入被拒，不覆盖接管者的新状态"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "接管语义",
      "items": [
        "reconcileExecution 受 mayReconcile 闸门约束并落 execution.requeued 事件；READY 后任一 worker 可 claim",
        "同 worker 幂等续约；他 worker 在租约未过期时 claim → HarnessConflictException；过期后 fencing 递增"
      ]
    }
  ]
